📊 Dashboard Features & Insights
1️⃣ Sales Overview

Displays total sales, total profit, and quantity sold

Helps quickly understand overall business performance

KPI cards give a high-level summary at a glance

2️⃣ Sales Trend Analysis

Line and bar charts show sales trends over time

Helps identify:

Peak sales periods

Seasonal patterns

Sales growth or decline

3️⃣ Category & Product Performance

Visualizes sales by product category and sub-category

Identifies:

Best-selling products

Underperforming categories

Useful for inventory and marketing strategies

4️⃣ Customer Analysis

Analyzes customer purchasing behavior

Shows how different customer segments contribute to sales

Helps understand customer preferences

5️⃣ Regional / Store-Level Insights

Compares sales across different regions or store locations

Identifies high-performing and low-performing regions

Supports regional business planning

📈 Key Business Insights

Certain product categories consistently generate higher revenue

Sales show noticeable seasonal spikes

A small set of products contributes to a large portion of total sales

Regional performance varies significantly, indicating location-based demand differences
